title HUNK50 — the finger surface proper: a tap on a strip, a swipe left or right, becomes one edit gesture
prompt Continue the autonomous loop — next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, self-approve design rounds, send each finished increment as its own signed round, stop only at custody gates.
think HUNK49 closed the touchable-editor loop (a gesture edits, the view repaints from one cursor) and named its own next crux in plain words: bind a raw touch — a tap on a gesture strip, a swipe left/right — to gesture, as HUNK46 turned finger events into scroll moves. Both edit halves (HUNK48 seam, HUNK49 view) speak edit_input.Gesture, yet nothing turned a finger into one; a touchscreen reports pixel coordinates, not verb tags.
think Lindy-first crux-first picked the finger surface: the symmetric capstone the scroll arc already has (HUNK46), read every time a keeper edits by touch, composing only proven parts. Kept it pure over the finger and living entirely in image/ beside edit_input.rye — the classifier produces a Gesture and moves no cursor, leaving HUNK48 to apply, exactly the two-layer boundary HUNK43 kept for scroll (input pure, seam applies).
think Shape: image/edit_touch_input.rye EditTouch { strip: [max_strip]Edit, strip_len, cell_px, swipe_px, down_x, down_y, armed }. open validates cell_px and swipe_px positive (BadCell/BadSwipe caught once, so no later classification divides by a zero cell or compares a zero swipe); bind appends a verb refusing StripFull at the 16 ceiling; finger_down records+arms; finger_up returns ?Gesture — a horizontal travel past swipe_px is a walk (left undo, right redo) and wins over the landing cell, otherwise the landing x picks cell x/cell_px and commits its verb, a tap off the strip firing nothing. The delta is i64-clamped to i32 so a wild jump never wraps.
obs Built GREEN first metal run, no red — the REDS #76 loom held: the witness uses native `assert out contains "…"`, never printf-grep over interpolated output, so the selftest GREEN line's natural apostrophe (cell's verb) can never break a check. craft_tagged reuses HUNK48's exact helper (two compound asserts already seated in image/, which the tame scan does not cover); the module's own invariants are one-per-line.
obs Witness reads behavior on metal: a tap on cell 0 commits flip_h and edit_cursor.view of the image is exactly that verb byte-for-byte; a tap on cell 2 stacks rotate; a left swipe undoes to the one-verb image recovered byte-for-byte; a right swipe redoes forward unchanged; a tap past the last cell and a negative-x tap each fire nothing; a hard right drag starting over cell 0 reads as redo (the swipe winning over the tap); a zero cell and a zero swipe refuse at open, the strip ceiling refuses StripFull. HUNK48 seam and HUNK16 cursor GREEN beneath; tame_style_check bans clean, width exit 0.
loom witness=hunk_edit_touch_input_witness image=6x4_tagged strip=flip_h,flip_v,rotate1 cell_px=10 swipe_px=12 gestures=tap_commit,left_undo,right_redo drift_check=edit_cursor.view==by_hand refusals=BadCell,BadSwipe,StripFull
file image/edit_touch_input.rye HUNK50 — EditTouch classifies raw finger down/up into one edit_input.Gesture (tap commits a strip verb, swipe left/right walks the history), pure over the finger.
file tools/hunk_edit_touch_input_witness.rish proves the surface on metal — a tap commits exactly its verb byte-for-byte, swipes walk byte-for-byte, a tap off the strip fires nothing, a swipe wins over the tap, bad opens refuse.
file active-designing/20260813-204548_hunk-edit-touch-input-exploration.md self-approved design read.
file work-in-progress/REMEMBER.md git nib refreshed in this same work commit.
recommend keep-going — the Photos editing finger surface now stands parallel to HUNK46 for scroll; the whole editing story (input seam · touchable view · finger surface) closes symmetrically with the browse story. HUNK51 could paint the gesture strip on glass (a Skate row of verb chips reusing HUNK2's down-map, the finger surface and the painted view sharing HUNK49's cursor), record a raw gesture session content-addressed (composing HUNK12's edit store), or open a fresh Season-A / double-seat journey. The served-market module-assembly ruling and hardware buys stay Keaton's gates.
